sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client<br/>(keeps a cache)
    participant S as API
    C->>S: GET /devices/Q2SW-0001
    S-->>C: 200 OK · ETag: "Q2SW-0001-r1" · body (store it)
    Note over C,S: later: same resource again
    C->>S: GET /devices/Q2SW-0001 · If-None-Match: "Q2SW-0001-r1"
    alt unchanged
        S-->>C: 304 Not Modified · no body → reuse cached copy
    else changed
        S-->>C: 200 OK · new ETag · new body
    end
